  dialogueLines:
  - 'He is Sir Gareth, the Human Guardian. He twisted the very essence of peace into
    tyranny, all in the name of ''order.'' '
  - The truth... is his lie.The Spire's influence began with his ambition, his corruption.
  - The runes will show you how deep it goes. Seek them out.
